{"id":"6bcf31442528ac18","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STTypeRow.md","title":"STTypeRow","display":"STTypeRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STTypeRow","parameters":["B","C","k","z755","z756","z757"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STTypeRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>B</span><span>C</span><span>k</span><span>z755</span><span>z756</span><span>z757</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：简单类型判断与算法。有序参数：<code>B</code>、<code>C</code>、<code>k</code>、<code>z755</code>、<code>z756</code>、<code>z757</code>。</p>\n<p>独立声明式类型关系；绝不引用 Synth/Check。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STTypeRow B C k z755 z756 z757)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists g\n  (exists t\n    (exists a\n      (and\n        (exists z760 (and (@ Pair t a z760) (@ Pair g z760 z757)))\n        (and\n          (@ STJudValid B C k g t a)\n          (or\n            (exists z761 (and (@ TVar z761 t) (@ App g z761 a)))\n            (or\n              (exists z762 (and (@ TConst z762 t) (@ App k z762 a)))\n              (or\n                (exists z763\n                  (exists z764\n                    (exists z765\n                      (exists z766\n                        (and\n                          (@ TLam z763 z764 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ TArr z763 z765 a)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Cons z763 g z766)\n                            (exists z770\n                            (exists z771\n                            (and\n                            (in z770 z756)\n                            (and (@ App z755 z770 z771) (exists z772 (and (@ Pair z764 z765 z772) (@ Pair z766 z772 z771))))))))))))))\n                (exists z767\n                  (exists z768\n                    (exists z763\n                      (exists z769\n                        (and\n                          (@ TApp z767 z768 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ TArr z763 a z769)\n                            (and\n                            (exists z773\n                            (exists z774\n                            (and\n                            (in z773 z756)\n                            (and (@ App z755 z773 z774) (exists z775 (and (@ Pair z767 z769 z775) (@ Pair g z775 z774)))))))\n                            (exists z776\n                            (exists z777\n                            (and\n                            (in z776 z756)\n                            (and (@ App z755 z776 z777) (exists z778 (and (@ Pair z768 z763 z778) (@ Pair g z778 z777))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e67b18d4faf06437\" href=\"?note=e67b18d4faf06437\" title=\"ZFC_Cons\">Cons</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8f89421cb8aa301e\" href=\"?note=8f89421cb8aa301e\" title=\"ZFC_STJudValid\">STJudValid</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2f67326629fff1ce\" href=\"?note=2f67326629fff1ce\" title=\"ZFC_TArr\">TArr</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ce774aac70609584\" href=\"?note=ce774aac70609584\" title=\"ZFC_TConst\">TConst</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STTypeRow B C k z755 z756 z757)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STJudValid|STJudValid]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Cons","status":"resolved","id":"e67b18d4faf06437","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STJudValid|STJudValid]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZFC_TVar|TVar]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Cons|Cons]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_STJudValid|STJudValid]]；[[ZFC_TApp|TApp]]；[[ZFC_TArr|TArr]]；[[ZFC_TConst|TConst]]；[[ZFC_TLam|TLam]]；[[ZF